<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Gasoline"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Halsey"/><amll:meta key="album" value="BADLANDS (Deluxe Edition)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71507634"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440827791"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">你是否也同我一般疯癫 尝尽痛楚</text><text for="L2">像我这样挥霍百元买下昂贵香槟</text><text for="L3">只为将这烂玩意一股脑倒进水槽</text><text for="L4">你也会用昂贵的水费账单去擦拭污迹吗</text><text for="L5">你是否无需大麻便早已神魂颠倒</text><text for="L6">你也会像我这般撕裂自己去取悦看客吗</text><text for="L7">列车上的人们是否也会在背后对你窃窃私语</text><text for="L8">议论着你怎能如我这般糟蹋这副漂亮的皮囊</text><text for="L9">众人都冷眼说道</text><text for="L10">你无法醒来 这绝非一场幻梦</text><text for="L11">你是冰冷齿轮的一环 根本算不上血肉之躯</text><text for="L12">顶着精致无瑕的妆容 困锁在屏幕之中</text><text for="L13">自尊早已消磨殆尽 只能靠汽油饮鸩止渴</text><text for="L14">喔 喔</text><text for="L15">我想是我的代码出了差错</text><text for="L16">喔 喔</text><text for="L17">脑海中的呓语始终不肯放过我</text><text for="L18">我空有一颗赤诚的心 双手却早已冰冷彻骨</text><text for="L19">你是否也如我这般癫狂 举止怪异</text><text for="L20">像我一样划亮火柴 只为将烈焰生生吞咽</text><text for="L21">你也会自诩为一场肆虐的风暴吗</text><text for="L22">像我一样总是指责别人 从不肯承担过错</text><text for="L23">看客们齐声说道</text><text for="L24">你无法脱身 这根本不是梦境</text><text for="L25">你是流水线上的零件 不再属于活生生的人类</text><text for="L26">涂抹着精致的面具 在荧屏里苟延残喘</text><text for="L27">自卑渗入骨髓 全凭汽油驱动躯壳</text><text for="L28">喔 喔</text><text for="L29">或许是我的灵魂底层写满了错漏</text><text for="L30">喔 喔</text><text for="L31">那些纷扰的杂音挥之不去</text><text for="L32">我的心如金子般纯善 双手却依然冰冷</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ashley Frangipane &amp; Peder Losnegård</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:00.273"><div begin="0:31.675" end="3:00.273"><p begin="0:31.675" end="0:35.835" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.675" end="0:31.855">Are</span> <span begin="0:31.855" end="0:32.135">you</span> <span begin="0:32.135" end="0:32.285">in</span><span begin="0:32.285" end="0:32.865">sane</span> <span begin="0:32.865" end="0:33.385">like</span> <span begin="0:33.385" end="0:33.865">me,</span> <span begin="0:33.865" end="0:34.165">been</span> <span begin="0:34.165" end="0:34.355">in</span> <span begin="0:34.355" end="0:34.875">pain</span> <span begin="0:34.875" end="0:35.365">like</span> <span begin="0:35.365" end="0:35.835">me?</span></p><p begin="0:35.835" end="0:39.655" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.835" end="0:36.145">Bought</span> <span begin="0:36.145" end="0:36.325">a</span> <span begin="0:36.325" end="0:36.865">hundred</span> <span begin="0:36.865" end="0:37.175">dol</span><span begin="0:37.175" end="0:37.295">lar</span> <span begin="0:37.295" end="0:37.935">bottle</span> <span begin="0:37.935" end="0:38.065">of</span> <span begin="0:38.065" end="0:38.385">cham</span><span begin="0:38.385" end="0:38.845">pagne</span> <span begin="0:38.845" end="0:39.385">like</span> <span begin="0:39.385" end="0:39.655">me</span></p><p begin="0:39.901" end="0:43.631" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.901" end="0:40.131">Just</span> <span begin="0:40.131" end="0:40.251">to</span> <span begin="0:40.291" end="0:40.641">pour</span> <span begin="0:40.641" end="0:40.871">that</span> <span begin="0:40.871" end="0:41.151">moth</span><span begin="0:41.151" end="0:41.231">er</span><span begin="0:41.231" end="0:41.641">fuck</span><span begin="0:41.641" end="0:41.761">er</span> <span begin="0:41.761" end="0:42.141">down</span> <span begin="0:42.141" end="0:42.271">the</span> <span begin="0:42.271" end="0:42.891">drain</span> <span begin="0:42.891" end="0:43.341">like</span> <span begin="0:43.341" end="0:43.631">me?</span></p